<title>USA: Zapata declares $0.07 qtrly cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Zapata declares $0.07 qtrly cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zapata Corp said Friday it would start a quarterly dividend program and declared a quartely cash dividend of $0.07 a share.</p>
<p>Zapata said it would pay the dividend on August 1 to shareholders of record on July 25.</p>
<p>Zapata's chief executive Avram Glazer said in a statement the company currently has more than $95 in cash and securities.</p>
<p>&quot;We feel that initiating a quarterly dividend program will enhance the appeal of Zapata's stock,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
